  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of cultural identity in the Paraguayan Chaco to reinforce communities` ties to the land</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin Sombra de rbol (ASdeA) will work with indigenous and creole communities in the remote Paraguayan Chaco? a region challenged with extreme poverty a lack of government presence and harsh environment - to improve their livelihoods and food security through smallholder agricultural practices and the promotion and strengthening of their cultural heritage. Approximately 2175 people will benefit directly and 10100 indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
